body:
- the same target with the engine's `tracing` compiled (`--features dioxus-native-dom/tracing`, as the previous chunk
  read it), so the engine item and the sink's engine line are read locally as the workspace leg reads them in CI
  (test-plan · decision/per-package-green-not-workspace-green);

- the companions the diff moves:
  - `stand_mcp_tools` and seven_guis' `mcp_server` and `cli_commands`: `caused`'s help is served by `help` and as
    the acting tools' descriptions, the same bytes on both surfaces;
  - `stand_act_errors`, `stand_replay` and `stand_act_spans`;
  - escher-telemetry's process checks `telemetry_scrub`, `telemetry_drop` and `telemetry_panic_hook`, and seven_guis'
    `host_log` and `mcp_log`, which show that the sink prints what it printed;
